    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Bangla Font Collection for Gutenberg. You can change post content font and font size. Make your post content more beautiful.</p>\n<h3>Font Licenses</h3>\n<p>Each font distributed through this Plugin comes with its own individual license. Users must comply with the specific license terms of each font they use. Please refer to the individual font directory for their respective license details.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>Step 1. Download the Plugin from  from official WordPress Plugin Directory.</p>\n<p>Step 2. Upload it in you wp-content/plugins directory.</p>\n<p>Step 3. Activate it from Admin panel.</p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='can%20i%20add%20more%20fonts%3F'>\nCan I add more fonts?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Ans: Yes..</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.00</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add many new feature</li>\n<li>User can now add as many as font they want.</li>\n<li>Support with latest version= 1.00 =</li>\n<li>This is the First Version.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
